{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54394","headline":"春日早朝 · 孙合","name":"春日早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三严（一作「年」）望仗正徘徊，曙色盈盈正（一作「金」）殿开。\n青琐侍香扶日出，紫霞护阙拥山来。\n班联鵷鹭仙官舞，影动龙蛇淑气催。\n禁秘天颜常咫尺，小臣（一作「欣忭」）愿进万年杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}